{"4250770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "在路上 On The Road", "steam_appid": 4250770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/45bd5cd34d576d57c04fd1fe3eb81055.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=553 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From the Home of Pandas to One of the World’s Highest Cities</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a camper van westward across vast landscapes, following one of the world’s most iconic highland routes.This is not a race—it’s a journey you can pause at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/b5f30d3e6c6acb830dd6b60a851fe983.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A road trip you can leave running in the background.<br>Your camper keeps moving while you work or study, keeping the journey quietly by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/5091bfeb0457023a07e58f1f5b0ec9bc.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/d2b9bba6460c4f0f0e885d1c82445219.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunny days, clouds, rain, snow…<br>The weather shifts constantly, making every departure feel a little different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/68258423f79653aa6f0c771bc1c647db.avif?t=1787579941\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras_big/68258423f79653aa6f0c771bc1c647db.avif?t=1787579941 width=1560 height=956 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/fe46f531534787d6ee87c4cbcb4d07ba.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your camper’s speed, fuel consumption, and tank capacity.<br>Stop to refuel, repair, and shop along the way—choose what to bring and slowly fill your camper with things you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/af02b4fcf02b06cdccb08338168e430e.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1448 height=1709 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/9f71330bea48ec7c1306fc1c99f0d6b4.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up your camera and capture the road.<br>Landscapes, travelers, small stories along the way—every photo is proof that you’ve been here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/476d5b18f702f568c8ccc5f510b268b7.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=922 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/55b6e0586ece86dd02727dc3d3813a6a.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed entirely by one person—me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I love nature, traveling, and photography, but real life often keeps me sitting at a desk.<br>I made this game hoping it could accompany me during work—and accompany you too—on a quiet journey beyond the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From working as a game artist to developing a full game on my own,<br>the game is growing, and so am I.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this journey resonates with you,<br>I hope you’ll consider adding On the Road to <strong><u>your wishlist</u></strong>.<br>It truly means a lot to a solo developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I share development logs regularly on <strong><u>X / Xiaohongshu</u></strong>,<br>and you’re always welcome to follow along as this journey takes shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— <strong>yoi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/45bd5cd34d576d57c04fd1fe3eb81055.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=553 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From the Home of Pandas to One of the World’s Highest Cities</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a camper van westward across vast landscapes, following one of the world’s most iconic highland routes.This is not a race—it’s a journey you can pause at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/b5f30d3e6c6acb830dd6b60a851fe983.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A road trip you can leave running in the background.<br>Your camper keeps moving while you work or study, keeping the journey quietly by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/5091bfeb0457023a07e58f1f5b0ec9bc.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/d2b9bba6460c4f0f0e885d1c82445219.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunny days, clouds, rain, snow…<br>The weather shifts constantly, making every departure feel a little different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/68258423f79653aa6f0c771bc1c647db.avif?t=1787579941\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras_big/68258423f79653aa6f0c771bc1c647db.avif?t=1787579941 width=1560 height=956 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/fe46f531534787d6ee87c4cbcb4d07ba.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your camper’s speed, fuel consumption, and tank capacity.<br>Stop to refuel, repair, and shop along the way—choose what to bring and slowly fill your camper with things you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/af02b4fcf02b06cdccb08338168e430e.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1448 height=1709 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/9f71330bea48ec7c1306fc1c99f0d6b4.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up your camera and capture the road.<br>Landscapes, travelers, small stories along the way—every photo is proof that you’ve been here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/476d5b18f702f568c8ccc5f510b268b7.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=922 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/extras/55b6e0586ece86dd02727dc3d3813a6a.avif?t=1787579941\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed entirely by one person—me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I love nature, traveling, and photography, but real life often keeps me sitting at a desk.<br>I made this game hoping it could accompany me during work—and accompany you too—on a quiet journey beyond the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From working as a game artist to developing a full game on my own,<br>the game is growing, and so am I.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this journey resonates with you,<br>I hope you’ll consider adding On the Road to <strong><u>your wishlist</u></strong>.<br>It truly means a lot to a solo developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I share development logs regularly on <strong><u>X / Xiaohongshu</u></strong>,<br>and you’re always welcome to follow along as this journey takes shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— <strong>yoi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "On the Road is a relaxing idle road-trip game that keeps you company while you work or study.Drive a camper van across vast highland landscapes, shaped by changing weather and scenery.Upgrade your vehicle, manage supplies, and capture the journey in your photo album.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/f76798e1e1abdc1e393bcebbd63cb663944cdabe/header.jpg?t=1787579941", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/572dc1260c772eb6e061980b8cd955057cbd8b1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787579941", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250770/572dc1260c772eb6e061980b8cd955057cbd8b1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787579941", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 或同等性能<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 64-bit processor and operating system required.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong